    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast, Boost, and Ascend!.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rise To Mayhem, you play as an elite jetpack soldier sent to ascend a mysterious alien tower that erupted from the Earth. Armed with powerful weapons, quick reflexes, and a thirst for chaos, you'll fight swarms of enemies, dodge deadly traps, defeat massive bosses, and gather powerful upgrades as you climb ever higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: survive as long as possible, rise as high as you can, and rack up the highest score before you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intense pixel-art action, satisfying power-ups, and endless replayability, <i>Rise to Mayhem</i> delivers a retro-inspired, adrenaline-fueled experience for fans of arcade shooters and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack-powered vertical shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tower and enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades and character-enhancing power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal boss battles that test your reflexes and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score chasing with survival-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisp pixel art visuals inspired by retro classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and full controller support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast, Boost, and Ascend!.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rise To Mayhem, you play as an elite jetpack soldier sent to ascend a mysterious alien tower that erupted from the Earth. Armed with powerful weapons, quick reflexes, and a thirst for chaos, you'll fight swarms of enemies, dodge deadly traps, defeat massive bosses, and gather powerful upgrades as you climb ever higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: survive as long as possible, rise as high as you can, and rack up the highest score before you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intense pixel-art action, satisfying power-ups, and endless replayability, <i>Rise to Mayhem</i> delivers a retro-inspired, adrenaline-fueled experience for fans of arcade shooters and roguelites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack-powered vertical shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated tower and enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful upgrades and character-enhancing power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal boss battles that test your reflexes and skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score chasing with survival-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisp pixel art visuals inspired by retro classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and full controller support</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ascend a deadly tower, blast through waves of enemies, dodge incoming fire, battle fierce bosses, and chase high scores in explosive pixel-art action as a jetpack soldier.",
